{"title":"Eel Kelp","slug":"Eel_Kelp","hero":{"file":"Eel_Kelp.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":3157,"revid":22106,"timestamp":"2026-08-07T10:11:43Z","lastEditor":"Macciiek","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Eel Kelp"},{"label":"Log","value":"$11.25/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$121.5/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$151.88/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.62.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"obtaining","text":"Obtaining"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Eel Kelp</b> is a variation of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Kelp/\">Kelp</a> that is created when Kelp is struck by lightning, either naturally or through the use of a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Michael's_Copper_Axe/\">Copper Axe</a>.\n</p><p>It can be identified by its olive green trunk/leaves and green electricity particles emanating from it.\n</p><p><b>Requires a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Steel_Axe/\">Steel Axe</a> or greater.</b>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"obtaining\">Obtaining</h2>\n<p>Eel Kelp can be found anywhere normal Kelp spawns, it is created after Kelp is struck by lightning, either naturally or through the use of a Copper Axe. It is <b>highly recommended</b> to use the Copper Axe method, as it is very rare for them to spawn naturally.\n</p><p>As of the 1.67.0 update, Eel Kelp can spawn in Electrified Meteor crash sites.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"372fd5e5701d0aaf753f1ff28a743f42\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></span></div></div><div>Log</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></span></div></div><div>Sanded</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></span></div></div><div>Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Eel kelp is one of 3 Electrified trees in Oaklands.</li>\n<li>Out of the 3 electric trees, eel kelp sells for the most when processed.</li></ul>"}
